Clifford: "pompous"? Dated, perhaps; but I have accidentally insulted many 
people with the "general you", so it might be worth sounding like a 
20th-century man to avoid that.

Of course, I'm only speaking for myself though; I still use the word "lest" 
(and sometimes "amongst", though I don't know why), and I pronounce "iff" 
as "ifof". I tinker with English about as much as I do with Lojban :p

